+| Progression payoff | 9/10 | Chapter 3, Cael refuses the unseen read in the silent yard; Chapter 4, he earns the touch but immediately meets the shortened two-ended grip; Chapter 5, “He is better at this than I am.” | Skill growth includes restraint, failure, opponent adaptation, and accurate self-assessment. The system trials also establish precise affordances likely to support later payoffs. | High |
